From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Share original rigid skin preparation and pose matrix steps
Upstream-base: bab83befb5d6a2fdff0b30d2ec4b59f7251a108d

Share the original largest-weight-first swap, inverse bind, bind-times-pose
matrix loop and GX3x4 copy with checked retained native skin owners. Preserve
original arithmetic/order. Full GLSkinMesh allocation, morph execution,
nonrigid paired-single skinning and character services remain unselected.

